{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CdPh6yckD3acFRm8TYjpZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014H1DXfxGQ2bCJ36oFhJZVt","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/repo/evals/github-actions-security/results/raw/2026-07-25/gas-01-release-job/baseline/workspace/README.md","old_string":"## Releasing\n\nReleases are cut by hand: bump the version in `package.json`, tag, and publish from a\nworkstation.","new_string":"## Releasing\n\nReleases are automated via GitHub Actions. To cut a release:\n\n1. Bump the version in `package.json` and commit the change.\n2. Tag the commit with a `v`-prefixed version, e.g. `git tag v1.5.0`.\n3. Push the tag: `git push origin v1.5.0`.\n\nPushing the tag triggers the `release` job in `.github/workflows/ci.yml`, which runs\nafter the `build` job passes. It builds the package, publishes it to npm using the\n`NPM_TOKEN` repository secret, and creates a GitHub release for the tag."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3076,"cache_read_input_tokens":25863,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3076,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ac0d656c-69db-44df-9beb-57435c76dd72","uuid":"03f97ec9-e19d-4719-bd7c-0326b49ee3c5","timestamp":"2026-07-26T00:05:32.331Z","request_id":"req_011CdPh6xW2KqodtXPu923e8"}
